{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e8f2a1d0-5c3e-4b1a-9e2a-edusphere0001",
    "name": "EduSphere API",
    "description": "Auth (Passport) + Courses + Categories API for the EduSphere LMS.\n\n1. Set `base_url` in the collection variables (defaults to `http://127.0.0.1:8000` for `php artisan serve`).\n2. Run **Auth > Login (Admin)** or **Auth > Login (User)** first — the access token is captured automatically into `{{access_token}}` and reused by every other request's Bearer auth.\n3. Seeded accounts (see `database/seeders/AdminUserSeeder.php`):\n   - admin@example.com / 12345678 (role: admin)\n   - user@example.com / 12345678 (role: user)\n   - instructor@example.com / 12345678 (role: instructor)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "course_slug", "value": "uiux-design-fundamentals", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "course_id", "value": "9", "type": "string" },
